+++++ * ISIN → country / region resolver.
+++++ *
+++++ * The first 2 chars of an ISIN are the ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code of
+++++ * the registering authority — NOT necessarily where the company operates
+++++ * or trades. Examples:
