+++- * Wealthfolio Expert — AI assistant specialized in Donkeyfolio internals,
+++- * the TR Importer addon, and PT IRS for portfolio investors.
+++- *
+++- * Architecture:
+++- *   - Bring-your-own-key (BYOK) Anthropic API key, stored encrypted via
