+The core compiler expands INTEREST+subtype=STAKING_REWARD (with an FMV
+unit_price) into INTEREST income (qty×FMV) + a BUY at FMV — so staking rewards
+show as real income AND the token lot gets a cost basis. mapFreeReceipt now
+emits that (falls back to zero-cost TRANSFER_IN only when TR ships no FMV). The
+backfill SQL re-types the 82 existing reward rows the same way; Rebuild History
+then expands them — no re-import.
